WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Mark eight dots 4 mm apart for 6 mm sequins.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Bring the needle up at the first dot and slide on a sequin.
Stitch just beyond its rim, toward the next dot.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.600
Add the next sequin so it overlaps the first.
Stitch it down in the same direction.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:20.000
Continue along the line.
Check that the sequins lie flat and overlap evenly.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Secure the last sequin with a second stitch
from its centre over a different part of the rim.
